{'symbol': 'RSG', 'date': '2022-05-16 09:04:00', 'title': 'REPUBLIC SERVICES CHARITABLE FOUNDATION AWARDS 10 NATIONAL NEIGHBORHOOD PROMISE® GRANTS FOR 2022', 'text': 'CLOSE TO $2 MILLION IN GRANTS TO SUPPORT SUSTAINABLE GREEN SPACES, COMMUNITY CENTERS AND HOUSING PHOENIX , MAY 16, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- THE REPUBLIC SERVICES, INC. (NYSE: RSG) CHARITABLE FOUNDATION TODAY NAMED 10 GRANT RECIPIENTS FOR ITS 2022 NATIONAL NEIGHBORHOOD PROMISE® PROGRAM, A NATIONWIDE COMMUNITY REVITALIZATION INITIATIVE. THE GRANTS WILL PRIMARILY SUPPORT LOCAL CHAPTERS OF NATIONAL NONPROFIT ORGANIZATIONS – REBUILDING TOGETHER, HABITAT FOR HUMANITY INTERNATIONAL AND NEIGHBORWORKS AMERICA – TO BUILD SUSTAINABLE GREEN SPACES, REFRESH COMMUNITY SPACES AND PROVIDE HOUSING FOR THOSE IN NEED.'}